+  exact exists_opposedSureOwner_optionalReversals_of_membershipStretch_positiveMinimum_finFour
+    original (quittingOwnSingletonReward singletons coordinates) halpha halpham hagrees
+      horiginalBound hfinalBound root optional hsure hfinalPositive hfinalOrder hminimum
